'''Wetyin''' was a continent located on [[Yavin 4]], a [[jungle]] [[moon]] of the [[gas giant]] [[Yavin Prime|Yavin]].<ref name="ROUVG" /> It notably housed the [[Massassi Site]], home of the [[Great Temple]].<ref name="The Rebel Files" />

